# Godot writes a .uid next to every script it imports. A probe script that an
# agent created, ran and deleted leaves its .uid behind while the .gd is gone —
# an untracked stub that no scope owns, and `git add -A` commits it happily.
godot/_probe_*.gd
godot/_probe_*.gd.uid
# Von `googleplay/scripts/install-export-preset.mjs` nach godot/ kopiert
# (Quelle: googleplay/scripts/validate-presets.gd).
godot/_cfgtest.gd
godot/_cfgtest.gd.uid
# Leftovers of a manual run in the repository root. `/build/` holds the exported
# APKs — `*.apk` above covers the files, the empty directory is still noise.
# NOTE: `backup/` is deliberately NOT ignored, the dashboard history belongs in
# the repository (AGENTS.md).
nohup.out
*.tmp
*.bak
*.orig
*.rej
*.swp
.env.local
.env.*.local
/build/
